{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21201","headline":"酬乐天登乐游园见忆 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天登乐游园见忆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔君乐游园，怅望天欲曛。\n今我大江上，快意波飜云。\n秋空压澶漫，澒洞无垢氛。\n四顾皆豁达，我眉今日伸。\n长安隘朝市，百道走埃尘。\n轩车随对列，骨肉非本亲。\n夸游丞相第，偷入常侍门。\n爱君直如发，勿念江湖人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}